  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c24bcdfd65d69c300b3/step-2a697c00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook fusilli in the boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c24bcdfd65d69c300b3/step-de905510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini and mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins. Add tomato & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in passata, the brown sugar, butter and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through cooked fusilli and veggies, until combined. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c24bcdfd65d69c300b3/step-bffbbc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mushroom and tomato fusilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c24bcdfd65d69c300b3/step-0830db30.jpg"
    }
  ]
